    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want a counselor, i just want the noise to stop. everything i do just makes it worse. i thought doing the right thing would mean something, but it just left me empty. it's like i'm just a ghost in a world that doesn't even want me here. sometimes i look at how much easier it would be if i just... wasn't a part of this anymore. if there was just peace. it feels like the only way to actually win against a system this broken is to just stop playing the game entirely.",
